[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やーっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hiyaaa!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわぁっ！\u3000参りました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gwaah! I surrender!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "挑戦者の男Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Challenger A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おっと！\u3000堂免家家臣の中でも屈指の力自慢が\n早くも降参だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And there we have it! One of the strongest fighters among the Doumen retainers has already thrown in the towel!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "軽々と吹っ飛ばされてましたな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She sent him flying with ease!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お次は拙者が！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall be next!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "挑戦者の男Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Challenger B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とうっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次は私よ！\u3000この槍技、防げるかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My turn! Can you block my spear technique?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "挑戦者の女",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Female Challenger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "動けなければ意味がありません！\u3000やあっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you can't move, it won't matter! Yaah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、挑戦者を次々と封じていく！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna defeats challenger after challenger!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おーっと！\u3000異邦人の錬金術士アンペルの登場だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And now we have the wanderer alchemist Empel entering the ring!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術対決というのも、面白いだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An alchemy duel should prove quite entertaining."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンペル先輩！\u3000望むところです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mister Empel! I accept your challenge!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "息を呑む戦いです！\u3000しかし、何が行われて\nいるのか、さっぱり分からぬ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A breathtaking battle! Though I confess, I have no idea what's happening!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術の達人同士の戦いとは、これほどまでに精緻かつ\n高度な技の応酬となるのか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is this what happens when two master alchemists face off? Such intricate and advanced techniques!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ……なんという気迫だ。\n勝負を望むだけのことはある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... What incredible spirit. She truly is eager for battle."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "時間切れだな。次は私だ。\n一度本気で戦ってみたいと思っていた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Time's up. I'm next. I've been wanting to fight you seriously for a while now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンペルに続き、華麗なる戦士リラの登場だ！\n彼女なら、神様の意思を満足させてくれるか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Following Empel, the graceful warrior Lila takes the stage! Will she be able to satisfy the divine will?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "リラさん、さすがです！\u3000でも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're amazing as always, Lila! But still!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふ。ここまで本気で戦ったのも久しぶりだ。\n強くなったな、レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh. It's been a while since I fought this seriously. You've gotten stronger, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふっふっふ。ここはあたしの出番ね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heheheh. Time for me to step in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "マルローネ先輩がお相手してくれるなんて、光栄です！\nでも、爆弾の１つや２つ、見切ってみせます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm honored to face you, Miss Marie! But I can dodge one or two bombs, no problem!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、１０個や２０個ならどう！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then how about ten or twenty?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお！\u3000これは面白いですね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh! Now this is interesting!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだまだ疲れてすらいないか。やるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's not even tired yet. Impressive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神様の意思は、祓うことができぬでござろうか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Can the divine will not be exorcised?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "神の意思に取り憑かれたと聞いた。\nどんな状態なのか直接確認してやろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard you were possessed by a divine will. I'll see for myself what state you're in."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キースグリフ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keithgriff"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしたちが相手だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're your opponents!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユーディー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Judie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこだっ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キースグリフ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keithgriff"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……なるほど、興味深かった。ではな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see. How fascinating. I'm done here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キースグリフ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keithgriff"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ！？\u3000それだけ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?! That's it?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユーディー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Judie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなら、こういうのはどうだー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then how about this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ、ロロナ先輩。もしかして、おやつを持ってきて\nくださったんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, did you bring snacks, Miss Rorona?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "甘いぜレスナ！\u3000正攻法じゃ勝てねぇかもしれないが、\n俺たちの心の籠った料理なら！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not so fast, Resna! We might not win in a straight fight, but with food made from the heart!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イクセル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Iksel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃん！\u3000これを食べて、正気に戻ってー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna! Eat this and come back to your senses!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むぐ……美味しいです、ごちそうさまでした！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmph... Delicious! Thank you for the meal!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺の料理でも……心が動かない、だと！？\n負けたあああ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even my cooking... couldn't move her heart?! I've been defeated!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イクセル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Iksel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すごい！\u3000すごい戦いだ！\u3000腕に覚えのある猛者どもが\n次から次へと捌かれていく！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Amazing! What an incredible battle! One skilled fighter after another is being dispatched!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（みんな、力いっぱい戦ってる。でも楽しそうだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Everyone's fighting with everything they've got. But they look like they're having fun.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そうだ。そんなに堅苦しく考えなくてもいい）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That's right. I don't need to overthink this.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（今のアタシが、どれだけレスナに食いつけるか。\n\u3000それでいいんだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I just need to show Resna how much I can keep up with her. That's all.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ！\u3000このアルビちゃんが相手だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna! Your opponent is Alvie!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うんっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]